                                "sense_id": "53e2b6b4-013a-3e25-a437-422882be6cac",
                                "text": "By this ſecret ſubterrane vault, Zedechias making his ſtealth, recouered (by the helpe of the darke night) the plaines or deſerts of Iericho: […]"
                            },
