                                "sense_id": "53e2b6b4-013a-3e25-a437-422882be6cac",
                                "text": "The waters stir, / Not as with air, but by some subterrane / And rocking power of the internal world."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a850e2f-2149-46e6-be86-ba0b59d225fe",
                                "sense_id": "53e2b6b4-013a-3e25-a437-422882be6cac",
                                "text": "I watched men in moon suits bury drums of nuclear waste and I thought of the living rocks down there, the subterrane process, the half-life, the atoms that decay to half the original number."
                            }
                        ]
